  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Single-word comparatives",
     "texto": [
      "The one-word forms we practise here — **больше**, **дороже**, **лучше** — do not change for gender or number.",
      "**больше** (bigger), **меньше** (smaller), **лучше** (better), **хуже** (worse), **дороже** (more expensive), **дешевле** (cheaper), **красивее** (prettier), **быстрее** (faster).",
      "To compare ages: **старше** (older) and **младше** (younger)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Than: чем",
     "texto": [
      "«Than» is **чем**, with a comma before it: **Москва больше, чем Мадрид** = Moscow is bigger than Madrid.",
      "**Синяя куртка красивее, чем чёрная** = the blue jacket is prettier than the black one."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
